1
00:02:45,714 --> 00:02:51,714
A Scream in the Night is a thriller, crime, mystery
film directed by Fred C. Newmeyer.

2
00:05:31,428 --> 00:05:37,428
A colonial police detective in an Eastern seaport seeks a stolen gem, and
infiltrates the underworld by posing as a look-alike wharfside bar owner.

3
00:08:17,142 --> 00:08:23,142
Jack Wilson / Butch Curtain, played by Lon Chaney Jr..

4
00:11:02,857 --> 00:11:08,857
Joe Bentley, played by John Ince.

5
00:13:48,571 --> 00:13:54,571
Mora, played by Zarah Tazil.

6
